\f0\fs24 \cf0 # Project KARMA\
\
## Vision\
\
Project KARMA (Karmadevi Automated Response Mechanism Assistant)\
is a WhatsApp-based conversational platform for employees of\
Karmadevi Group.\
\
The objective is to automate internal employee workflows.\
\
